			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761530101,
					"content": "出版業也不賺錢啊，不然乾脆只做投資算了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530102,
					"content": "想看看投資券…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761530103,
					"content": "好，投資券2000摩拉一張，每星期結算一次，嘿嘿，這個小袋子裡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530104,
					"content": "…呃！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530105,
					"content": "怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761530106,
					"content": "雅珂達，妳怎麼來了？是奈芙爾老闆有什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530107,
					"content": "沒有，我只是陪我朋友來這裡隨便逛逛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530108,
					"content": "嘿嘿，看來薩維特老闆的投資生意真的做得很好啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530109,
					"content": "普通！普通，哈哈哈…小本生意，餬口罷了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530110,
					"content": "（這丫頭…話裡有話！鐵定是奈芙爾派她過來的…嘖。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530111,
					"content": "這真的賺得了錢嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761530112,
					"content": "當然啦，老闆說了，薩維特老闆可是最最有聲望、最最有能力的商人，跟著他投資準沒錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530113,
					"content": "是…是…哈哈哈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530114,
					"content": "（果然是奈芙爾…！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530115,
					"content": "那什麼時候能結算投資…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761530116,
					"content": "今天！就在今天，您剛才買的是我們剛剛推出的…短線投資券！盈虧立即結算！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530117,
					"content": "怎麼感覺這些話都是你剛剛才編出來的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530118,
					"content": "呃…總、總之，感謝您購買短線投資券！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530119,
					"content": "這是您的投資回報，祝您擁有美好的一天！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530120,
						761530121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530120,
					"content": "總之賺錢是好事啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761530122,
					"content": "#真的？嘿嘿嘿，那{F#妳}{M#你}買一個小鳥形狀的給我，我喜歡那種的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530123,
					"content": "#欸，我和{F#妳}{M#你}們一起去，也帶一個回去給老闆。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530124,
					"content": "雅…雅珂達小姐，稍等！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530125,
					"content": "那個…奈芙爾老闆是否交代您了什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530126,
					"content": "啊，老闆說：「東西已經找到了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530127,
					"content": "「薩維特先生，不要心急。事情，要一步一步地做才穩當。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530128,
					"content": "是、是，奈芙爾老闆說得是…那就麻煩了，我就指望兩位了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "薩維特"
				},
				{
					"id": 761530121,
					"content": "走，派蒙，我們去買糖雕吃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761530122
					]
				}
			]
		},
